      "role": "user",
      "content": "I don't really get the goblin thing, can we just stick to the engineering? You mentioned how the steel helps with tensile forces. Can you explain the specific way the bond between the concrete and the steel works so the two materials actually act as a single unit rather than just sliding past each other?",
